What is devOps ?
DevOps is the process of improving the application delivery by ensuring the automation by maintaining the quality of code along with continous monitoring and continous testing .
                                                                                  (or)
DevOps is the process of building, deploying and testing the code written by developer on the same day instead of doing after complete development.. we can acheive this using continous integration, continous 
deployment, continous delivery and continous testing. We can do faster releases with less defect using DevOps... basically automation mindset to get the best results





Devops - Automation , Quality , Monitoring , Testing 
